                  "props": {
                    "text": "Leasing can provide a flexible alternative to growing your fleet and getting into a new truck, while mitigating some of the additional expenses involved with ownership. Save on taxes, fees, maintenance, and repairs.\n\nWith the Ballard Rent & Lease program, you won't have to worry about your trucks breaking down or aging over time. Easily walk away from one truck at lease-end and step into a new one.\n\nIf leasing sounds like the solution for you and your business, or if you have questions about the program, reach out to us through the Lease Request Form on the right, or call <a href=\"tel:+18882032701\">(888) 203-2701</a>.",
